for as many as over the ships hold sway, the best,
of them all each one will give a black sheep,
a female, with a lamb beneath her;

“Nestor, me urges on my heart and my manly spirit
to enter the army of men who are hostile,
near at hand, of the Trojans;

and on the outside white teeth
of a white-toothed boar held thick-set here and there,
well and skilfully;
